{
  "id": "c1-e21-civic-duty",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Civic duty",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you feel you owe to the community you live in?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever taken part in a local project or campaign?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how much do you know about how your town is run?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people have become less interested in public life?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e21-a1",
            "c1-e21-a2",
            "c1-e21-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people contributing to their community. Choose two of the pictures and say why the people might feel it is important to get involved, and what effect their actions could have.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways of getting involved do you think is the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e21-b1",
            "c1-e21-b2",
            "c1-e21-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people taking part in community life. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might gain from their involvement, and what could discourage them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what would encourage you to get more involved in your community?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to encourage people to take a more active part in public life, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e21-civic-duty",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas encourage people to take part in public life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e21-civic-duty",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most successful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about civic duty and public service.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should citizens be obliged to do some form of community service?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent can individuals really change the way their community is run?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think voting should be compulsory?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Why might some people feel disconnected from politics and public life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, could technology make democracy work better?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is it better to volunteer in your own community or to help abroad?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e21-civic-duty/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
